# Sets

thief-backpack-category-extrovert-name = Extrovert Kit
thief-backpack-category-extrovert-description =
    Who doesn't like a partner in crime, right? Includes:
    A Mind Control Implant, a hypopen filled with Nocturine,
    and a second pair of non-chameleon thieving gloves.
    Go get 'em, Tiger!

thief-backpack-category-getaway-name = Getaway Kit
thief-backpack-category-getaway-description =
    Got caught? No problem! This kit will help you run away
    with style! Includes: A set of speed boots, a hyper
    capacity power cell, a Freedom Implant, and 3 Hyperzine
    auto injectors. Gotta go fast!

thief-backpack-category-ninja-name = Ninja Kit
thief-backpack-category-ninja-description =
    A master of the ways of the Ninja...Well, more
    like a Spider Clan wannabe.
    Includes: A battery powered, chameleon stealth scarf, an
    EMP Implant, a bottle of Tanzinide, a Hypopen and a
    Scram Implant.

thief-backpack-category-infiltrator-name = Infiltrator Kit
thief-backpack-category-infiltrator-description =
    Walls are just a suggestion! Nothing is stopping you!
    Includes: A breaching hammer, an RCD, a contortionist
    jumpsuit, and a full EVA Suit. Coming through!

thief-backpack-category-saboteur-name = Saboteur Kit
thief-backpack-category-saboteur-description =
    The shadows are a thief's best friend.
    Includes: 3 EMP Grenades, Cybernetic Night Vision
    eyes, an Engineering ID Card, insulated gloves and
    wirecutters.

thief-backpack-category-pilot-name = Pilot Kit
thief-backpack-category-pilot-description =
    You took a quick shuttle piloting course with the
    fellas down at the Syndicate before this.
    Includes: A Syndicate Shuttle construction bundle,
    a full Syndicate EVA suit, a black jetpack and blood
    red magboots. All aboard and buckle up!

thief-backpack-category-bluespace-name = Bluespace Kit
thief-backpack-category-bluespace-description =
    Who knew harnessing the power of bluespace would
    make such an effective thief?
    Includes: A pair of Quantum spin inverters, a
    Bluespace Backpack, and 4 Bluespace Crystals.

thief-backpack-category-self-defence-name = Self Defence Kit
thief-backpack-category-bluespace-description =
    I WILL NOT BE HARASSED! BITCH!
    Includes: A disabler, a telescopic shield, a force
    field projector, an armor vest, and a combat medkit.

thief-backpack-category-self-prankster-name = Prankster Kit
thief-backpack-category-prankster-description =
    Honk.
    Includes: A pie cannon, 2 extra pies, no-slip clown
    shoes, a banana energy sword and a holopeel projector.
    Bottom Text.

